sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Proxy as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant REST as MLServer REST<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant GRPC as MLServer gRPC<br/>8081/TCP gRPC
    participant DP as DataPlane Handler
    participant Batcher as Adaptive Batcher
    participant Registry as Model Registry
    participant Runtime as ML Runtime<br/>(sklearn/XGBoost/LightGBM/ONNX)
    participant Models as /mnt/models<br/>(PVC/S3 Mount)
    participant Metrics as Metrics Server<br/>8082/TCP
    participant Kafka as Kafka Broker<br/>9092/TCP
    participant OTel as OTel Collector<br/>gRPC

    Note over Client,OTel: Flow 1: Synchronous REST Inference

    Client->>Proxy: POST /v2/models/{name}/infer<br/>HTTPS/8443, Bearer Token
    Proxy->>REST: Forward HTTP/8080<br/>(localhost, plaintext)
    REST->>DP: InferenceRequest
    DP->>Registry: lookup model
    Registry-->>DP: MLModel instance
    DP->>Batcher: queue request (if batching enabled)
    Batcher->>Runtime: batched inference
    Runtime->>Models: load model artifacts<br/>(filesystem read)
    Models-->>Runtime: .pkl/.bst/.onnx/.cbm
    Runtime-->>Batcher: InferenceResponse
    Batcher-->>DP: response
    DP-->>REST: InferenceResponse + CloudEvents headers
    REST-->>Proxy: HTTP 200 JSON
    Proxy-->>Client: HTTPS response

    Note over Client,OTel: Flow 2: Synchronous gRPC Inference

    Client->>Proxy: ModelInfer RPC<br/>HTTPS/8443, Bearer Token
    Proxy->>GRPC: Forward gRPC/8081<br/>(localhost, plaintext)
    GRPC->>DP: InferenceRequest (protobuf)
    DP->>Registry: lookup model
    Registry-->>DP: MLModel instance
    DP->>Runtime: inference
    Runtime-->>DP: InferenceResponse
    DP-->>GRPC: response (protobuf)
    GRPC-->>Proxy: gRPC response
    Proxy-->>Client: HTTPS response

    Note over Client,OTel: Flow 3: Streaming Inference (REST SSE)

    Client->>Proxy: POST /v2/models/{name}/infer_stream<br/>HTTPS/8443
    Proxy->>REST: Forward HTTP/8080
    REST->>DP: StreamingInferenceRequest
    DP->>Runtime: streaming inference
    loop SSE Events
        Runtime-->>DP: partial response
        DP-->>REST: chunk
        REST-->>Proxy: text/event-stream chunk
        Proxy-->>Client: SSE event
    end

    Note over Client,OTel: Flow 4: Async Kafka Inference

    Client->>Kafka: Publish to input topic<br/>TCP/9092
    Kafka->>DP: KafkaServer consumes message<br/>TCP/9092
    DP->>Runtime: inference
    Runtime-->>DP: InferenceResponse
    DP->>Kafka: Publish to output topic<br/>TCP/9092
    Kafka-->>Client: Consumer reads response

    Note over Client,OTel: Observability Flows

    Metrics->>Metrics: Aggregate multiprocess metrics<br/>(PROMETHEUS_MULTIPROC_DIR)
    REST-->>OTel: OTLP traces (gRPC, insecure)
    GRPC-->>OTel: OTLP traces (gRPC, insecure)
